        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Called when this-&gt;<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value_handle_base_1a7d6d2457c839e340266704440f3bb243" kindref="member">getValPtr()</ref>-&gt;replaceAllUsesWith(new_value) is called, <emphasis>before</emphasis> any of the uses have actually been replaced. If <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_weak_tracking_v_h" kindref="compound">WeakTrackingVH</ref> were implemented as a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_callback_v_h" kindref="compound">CallbackVH</ref>, it would use this method to call setValPtr(new_value). <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_asserting_v_h" kindref="compound">AssertingVH</ref> would do nothing in this method. </para>
